<!---
	The outer shell for the site's own homepage (`docs/index.md`'s own
	`layout: home` frontmatter) - selected in place of `layout.bxm` via
	ThemeRenderer.renderPage()'s own `layoutHint`. Same theme approach as
	the bxSites homepage (same helper functions, same data-theme
	convention, same section patterns), with content and an accent
	palette specific to cbGenesis. Never includes `#variables.bodyFile#` -
	the whole page is hardcoded here, so `docs/index.md`'s own Markdown
	body is unused when this layout renders it.
--->
<bx:include template="#variables.moduleAssetsDir#/icons.bxm">
<bx:include template="#variables.moduleAssetsDir#/locale-flags.bxm">
<bx:script>
	/**
	 * Extra icon set for home.bxm's own marketing sections - real product
	 * marks for cbGenesis/ColdBox/BoxLang/CommandBox/TestBox, plus a
	 * handful of generic concept icons bxsitesIcon() (icons.bxm) doesn't
	 * cover (RBAC, ORM, request-lifecycle stages, the admin-panel mockup).
	 */
